// reference.js — the vocabulary tables: every pattern, timevar, function, player
// param, chained method and keyboard shortcut, with what each one does.
//
// Split out of docs.js because this is the part OTHER code needs. Alt+I builds its
// lookup from these five arrays, and it used to import them from a 472KB module —
// pulling the entire changelog (233KB) and the whole examples library (154KB) into
// the page to show a one-line tooltip. This file is 52KB and has no imports.
//
// It is also the list the transpiler is cross-checked against: anything here that
// returns a live {get} value has to be a name the transpiler recognises, or
// `that thing * 2` is NaN and the mix goes quiet. See tests/unit/transpiler.test.mjs.

// ── Static content ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

